"""Engineered features for the location family: feature definitions chosen during exploratory analysis and then computed deterministically. Because the location transform layer is intentionally empty (parcels already arrive at their native grain), these are computed directly from the raw parcel data read through the source registry. This layer owns the parcel growth-signal features — the per-parcel growth flags, the counts of flagged parcels within a quarter mile, the H3 growth-hotspot cells, and each parcel's distance to the nearest hotspot."""
